question:
Classify each of the following statements as True or False:
(a) A reaction occurring in a beaker is an example of an open system;
(b) Non-metals are reducing agents;
(c) A chemical equilibrium equation does not give information about the mechanism of a reaction;
(d) The order of the strength of a bond is $p\text{-}p > s\text{-}p > s\text{-}s$;
(e) Electron affinity is directly proportional to the tendency of anion formation.

Write the equation for the reaction of:
(i) calcium with A;
(ii) B with water.
